{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28436","headline":"怀锺陵旧游四首 一 · 杜牧","name":"怀锺陵旧游四首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一谒征南最少年，虞卿双璧截肪鲜。\n歌谣千里春长暖，丝管高台月正圆。\n玉帐军筹罗俊彦，绦帷环佩立神仙。\n陆公余德机云在，如我酬恩合执鞭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28436.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28436","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}